1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,702
Good morning, listeners.

2
00:00:03,652 --> 00:00:07,427
Today is October 16, 2026.

3
00:00:07,427 --> 00:00:13,076
Overnight, Wall Street mounted a dramatic late-day recovery after early panic selling.

4
00:00:13,076 --> 00:00:18,579
The Dow gained over five hundred fifty points, up one point zero eight percent.

5
00:00:18,579 --> 00:00:23,113
The S and P five hundred added zero point three three percent.

6
00:00:23,113 --> 00:00:28,052
The Nasdaq barely scratched out a gain of zero point zero eight percent.

7
00:00:28,052 --> 00:00:33,407
Macro data showed Producer Prices surging one point three percent month over month.

8
00:00:33,407 --> 00:00:38,015
That marks the steepest producer inflation jump since twenty twenty-two.

9
00:00:38,015 --> 00:00:43,898
Yet the benchmark ten-year Treasury yield actually retreated to five point zero nine percent.

10
00:00:43,898 --> 00:00:49,915
Investors treated bonds as an immediate liquidity haven rather than pricing in runaway inflation.

11
00:00:49,915 --> 00:00:54,228
Meanwhile, Asian markets suffered severe overnight shocks.

12
00:00:54,228 --> 00:00:59,976
The South Korean Kospi index plummeted over nine percent, triggering circuit breakers.

13
00:00:59,976 --> 00:01:05,981
Massive foreign capital fled overseas tech and flowed back into United States dollar assets.

14
00:01:05,981 --> 00:01:10,589
Emerging market fragility did not spread to American risk assets.

15
00:01:10,589 --> 00:01:17,182
However, market breadth shows real friction across the artificial intelligence capital expenditure complex.

16
00:01:17,182 --> 00:01:25,429
While Taiwan Semiconductor posted fifty percent revenue growth, gross margins slipped slightly to sixty-six point four percent.

17
00:01:25,429 --> 00:01:31,863
Advanced two-nanometer ramp costs and overseas fabrication expenses are eating into profitability.

18
00:01:31,863 --> 00:01:37,978
Crucially, management remained tight-lipped regarding twenty twenty-seven capital expenditure guidance.

19
00:01:37,978 --> 00:01:42,157
Investors are no longer rewarding high chip shipments blindly.

20
00:01:42,157 --> 00:01:49,375
Wall Street now intensely questions whether hyper-scaler artificial intelligence spending can maintain this exponential pace.

21
00:01:49,375 --> 00:01:56,728
Private frontier lab Anthropic saw third-quarter sequential revenue growth slow from triple digits to forty-five percent.

22
00:01:56,728 --> 00:02:01,790
This deceleration has cast fresh doubt on perpetual hyper-growth projections.

23
00:02:01,790 --> 00:02:06,643
Credit risk has also entered the artificial intelligence trade for the first time.

24
00:02:06,643 --> 00:02:13,640
CoreWeave, ticker symbol C-R-W-V, saw its bonds hit distress levels yielding fifteen percent.

25
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:19,094
Jensen Huang made public statements reaffirming the company's declining cost of capital.

26
00:02:19,094 --> 00:02:25,871
That helped C-R-W-V stock bounce six percent off intraday lows of fifty-nine dollars and fifty cents.

27
00:02:25,871 --> 00:02:31,238
Still, heavy overhead supply awaits between seventy-nine and eighty dollars.

28
00:02:31,238 --> 00:02:37,672
Pure-play computing rental firms face structural balance sheet leverage if graphics card rental rates soften.

29
00:02:37,672 --> 00:02:43,959
Treat C-R-W-V purely as a fast tactical swing, strictly capped in position size.

30
00:02:43,959 --> 00:02:48,444
Turning to memory maker Micron Technology, ticker symbol M-U.

31
00:02:48,444 --> 00:02:53,677
The stock experienced heavy volume stabilization after testing critical support.

32
00:02:53,677 --> 00:02:57,733
A secondary relief bounce could target twelve hundred dollars.

33
00:02:57,733 --> 00:03:05,981
Yet medium-term headwinds loom as domestic Chinese memory capacity ramps up, threatening artificial intelligence memory pricing power.

34
00:03:05,981 --> 00:03:09,143
Keep a trailing stop on long exposure.

35
00:03:09,143 --> 00:03:14,204
Finally, watch the Nasdaq index tracking fund, ticker Q-Q-Q.

36
00:03:14,204 --> 00:03:18,983
It found technical support at its long-term two-hundred-day moving average.

37
00:03:18,983 --> 00:03:23,873
Today is monthly options expiration, providing gamma pinning support.

38
00:03:23,873 --> 00:03:30,074
Trim aggressive long positions near the five-day and ten-day moving averages into subsequent strength.

39
00:03:30,074 --> 00:03:34,081
That concludes today's XiaoFang Finance Morning Brief.

40
00:03:34,081 --> 00:03:38,248
Thank you for listening, trade safely, and see you tomorrow.
